            <title><![CDATA[RBG v0.8.0 发布：节点预热、原地调度与更稳健的故障恢复]]></title>
            <link>https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0</link>
            <guid>https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0</guid>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[RBG v0.8.0 新增节点预热、原地调度和重启退避，减少推理服务重复准备资源的开销，并修复扩缩容、滚动更新和升级兼容性问题。]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="版本总结">版本总结<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 版本总结" title="Direct link to 版本总结">​</a></h2>
<p>v0.8.0 通过节点预热、原地调度和重启退避，减少推理服务启动与故障恢复中的重复开销，并修复扩缩容、滚动更新和升级兼容性问题。</p>
<p>升级前须<a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/blob/v0.8.0/deploy/helm/rbgs/README.md#breaking-change-values-regrouped-in-chart-v080" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">迁移 Helm 自定义配置</a>，旧配置会被忽略；<a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/437" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CRD 升级工具</a>的 kubectl 已更新为 v1.37.0，旧集群需<a href="https://kubernetes.io/releases/version-skew-policy/#kubectl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">核对版本兼容性</a>。服务发现及 alpha 升级提醒见下文。</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/releases/tag/v0.8.0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Release 详情</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/compare/v0.7.0...v0.8.0" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">相较上一正式版本的完整变更</a></li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="新特性">新特性<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E6%96%B0%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 新特性" title="Direct link to 新特性">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="节点预热提前准备镜像与运行环境">节点预热：提前准备镜像与运行环境<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E9%A2%84%E7%83%AD%E6%8F%90%E5%89%8D%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%E4%B8%8E%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 节点预热：提前准备镜像与运行环境" title="Direct link to 节点预热：提前准备镜像与运行环境">​</a></h3>
<p>新增 RoleBasedGroupWarmup，可在指定节点或已有 RBG 所在节点预拉取镜像、执行自定义预热任务，为后续部署或升级准备资源。任务支持并发控制、失败重试和超时限制，便于批量管理预热过程。</p>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/335" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#335</a> — feat: support RoleBasedGroup Warmup (phase 1)</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/379" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#379</a> — feat: refactor and implement warmup</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/TrafalgarZZZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@TrafalgarZZZ</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/NoobDream2568" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@NoobDream2568</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="原地调度让重建的-pod-复用节点缓存">原地调度：让重建的 Pod 复用节点缓存<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E5%8E%9F%E5%9C%B0%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6%E8%AE%A9%E9%87%8D%E5%BB%BA%E7%9A%84-pod-%E5%A4%8D%E7%94%A8%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 原地调度：让重建的 Pod 复用节点缓存" title="Direct link to 原地调度：让重建的 Pod 复用节点缓存">​</a></h3>
<p>启用原地调度后，重建的 Pod 可优先回到同一工作负载运行过的节点，复用已有镜像和模型缓存，减少重复准备资源的开销。</p>
<p>若选择强制回到历史节点，节点不可用时可能无法完成调度，使用前请了解<a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/blob/v0.8.0/doc/best-practice/zh/04-configuring-inplace-update-and-scheduling-policies.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">适用条件与限制</a>。</p>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/368" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#368</a> — feat(rbg): support inplace scheduling</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/NoobDream2568" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@NoobDream2568</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="重启退避减少连续故障引发的反复重建">重启退避：减少连续故障引发的反复重建<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%E9%80%80%E9%81%BF%E5%87%8F%E5%B0%91%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E5%BC%95%E5%8F%91%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8D%E5%A4%8D%E9%87%8D%E5%BB%BA" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 重启退避：减少连续故障引发的反复重建" title="Direct link to 重启退避：减少连续故障引发的反复重建">​</a></h3>
<p>对启用故障联动重建的角色实例，连续故障后的重建会逐步延后，避免短时间内反复重建整组 Pod。首次故障仍立即处理，后续重试间隔可按业务需要调整。</p>
<p>已有工作负载使用该重启策略时，也会默认启用退避；如需保持每次立即重建，可按<a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/blob/v0.8.0/doc/features/failure-handling.md#disabling-backoff" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">故障处理文档</a>关闭。</p>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/394" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#394</a> — feat: add exponential backoff for restart policy</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/409" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#409</a> — feat: add exponential backoff for restart policy with API and docs improvements</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/Syspretor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@Syspretor</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/diw-zw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@diw-zw</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="其他功能增强">其他功能增强<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E5%A2%9E%E5%BC%BA" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 其他功能增强" title="Direct link to 其他功能增强">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>更早发现配置错误</strong>：提交时即可拦截不合法的 RBG 名称、重复组件名及与 ScalingAdapter 不一致的手工副本修改，已有重名组件需在更新前修正。</li>
<li><strong>按需收紧控制器权限</strong>：新安装可禁用旧工作负载类型并移除相应权限，已有安装应保留默认兼容设置，详见<a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/blob/v0.8.0/deploy/helm/rbgs/README.md#deprecated-workload-types" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">使用限制</a>。</li>
<li><strong>更清晰的审计信息</strong>：各控制器的 API 请求带有独立标识，方便在 Kubernetes 审计日志中追踪请求来源。</li>
<li><strong>Model Express 集成示例</strong>：Dynamo SGLang 示例补充模型分发服务的接入说明，方便在 RBG 部署中配置模型分发加速。</li>
</ul>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/395" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#395</a> — feat: add admission webhook for rbg</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/435" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#435</a> — fix: reject duplicate roleinstance component names</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/416" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#416</a> — feat: restrict v1alpha1 API compatibility RBAC via Helm toggle</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/364" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#364</a> — feat: add ua for every controller</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/356" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#356</a> — docs: add Model Express integration to Dynamo SGLang examples</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/NoobDream2568" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@NoobDream2568</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/googs1025" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@googs1025</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/diw-zw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@diw-zw</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/vie-serendipity" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@vie-serendipity</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/Syspretor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@Syspretor</a></li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="重大-bug-修复">重大 bug 修复<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7-bug-%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 重大 bug 修复" title="Direct link to 重大 bug 修复">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="保持-v070-存量对象可读取">保持 v0.7.0 存量对象可读取<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81-v070-%E5%AD%98%E9%87%8F%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E5%8F%AF%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 保持 v0.7.0 存量对象可读取" title="Direct link to 保持 v0.7.0 存量对象可读取">​</a></h3>
<p>修复重启策略格式变化导致旧对象无法读取、控制器无法正常同步的问题。从 v0.7.0 升级无需改写已有重启策略。</p>
<p>曾部署 v0.8.0-alpha.3 或 alpha.4 的用户，须按<a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/blob/v0.8.0/doc/features/failure-handling.md#upgrading" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">升级说明</a>删除并重建受影响的 RBG 及关联资源，需安排可接受工作负载重建的维护窗口。</p>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/424" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#424</a> — fix: restore restartPolicy as a string to keep v0.7.0 objects decodable</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/diw-zw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@diw-zw</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="避免配置未变却触发滚动更新">避免配置未变却触发滚动更新<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E9%81%BF%E5%85%8D%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%98%E5%8D%B4%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E6%BB%9A%E5%8A%A8%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 避免配置未变却触发滚动更新" title="Direct link to 避免配置未变却触发滚动更新">​</a></h3>
<p>修复控制器升级后，业务配置没有变化却触发滚动更新的问题，减少不必要的 Pod 重建与模型重新加载。</p>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/433" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#433</a> — fix: add semantic revision equality check to prevent spurious rollouts</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/439" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#439</a> — Fix/upgrade spurious rollout and identity labels</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/diw-zw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@diw-zw</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="防止配置更新引发意外缩容">防止配置更新引发意外缩容<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E9%98%B2%E6%AD%A2%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E5%BC%95%E5%8F%91%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%96%E7%BC%A9%E5%AE%B9" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 防止配置更新引发意外缩容" title="Direct link to 防止配置更新引发意外缩容">​</a></h3>
<p>角色副本数由已绑定的 ScalingAdapter 管理时，Helm 升级或外部配置更新曾可能让副本数意外回落。本版保持实际工作负载与扩缩容目标一致，避免因此引发 Pod 缩减。</p>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/306" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#306</a> — fix(rbg-controller): override role.Replicas from bound RBGSA</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sebest" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@sebest</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="修复单副本角色协同更新停滞">修复单副本角色协同更新停滞<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E5%8D%95%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%8F%E5%90%8C%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E5%81%9C%E6%BB%9E" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 修复单副本角色协同更新停滞" title="Direct link to 修复单副本角色协同更新停滞">​</a></h3>
<p>修复单副本角色在均未就绪时，受协同滚动更新进度约束而无法开始更新的问题，让这类部署能够继续推进版本变更。</p>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/308" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#308</a> — fix: coordinatedPolicy rollingUpdate maxSkew stall RoleInstanceSet</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/JasonHe-WQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@JasonHe-WQ</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="修复小副本数更新与缩容到零被拦截">修复小副本数更新与缩容到零被拦截<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E5%B0%8F%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC%E6%95%B0%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%8E%E7%BC%A9%E5%AE%B9%E5%88%B0%E9%9B%B6%E8%A2%AB%E6%8B%A6%E6%88%AA" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 修复小副本数更新与缩容到零被拦截" title="Direct link to 修复小副本数更新与缩容到零被拦截">​</a></h3>
<p>修正百分比更新策略在小副本数场景下的校验，避免合法的滚动更新被拒绝；同时修复使用百分比不可用额度时，角色无法缩容到零的问题。</p>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/382" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#382</a> — feat: compute maxUnavailable correctly when validating rollout strategy</li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/431" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#431</a> — fix: validate rolling strategy only when replicas gt 0</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/vie-serendipity" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@vie-serendipity</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="让更新方式与宽限期按配置生效">让更新方式与宽限期按配置生效<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E8%AE%A9%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BD%E9%99%90%E6%9C%9F%E6%8C%89%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 让更新方式与宽限期按配置生效" title="Direct link to 让更新方式与宽限期按配置生效">​</a></h3>
<p>修复原地更新宽限期未生效、部分更新路径未遵循指定策略的问题，让工作负载按配置选择原地更新或重建，并在原地更新前保留设定的等待时间。</p>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/393" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#393</a> — fix: handle GracePeriodSeconds not correctly working and respect UpdateStrategy.Type</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/NoobDream2568" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@NoobDream2568</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="补齐-worker-pod-的-dns-身份">补齐 worker Pod 的 DNS 身份<a href="https://rolebasedgroup.github.io/blog/2026/08/31/v0.8.0#%E8%A1%A5%E9%BD%90-worker-pod-%E7%9A%84-dns-%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 补齐 worker Pod 的 DNS 身份" title="Direct link to 补齐 worker Pod 的 DNS 身份">​</a></h3>
<p>修复 RoleInstanceSet 的 leader-worker 角色在共享 Service 选择全部 Pod 时，worker 缺少独立 DNS 名称的问题，让依赖 Pod 域名的组件能够发现 worker。</p>
<p>升级提醒：未指定选择范围时，现在默认仅暴露 leader；依赖 worker 服务发现的用户须显式选择 <code>All</code>。已有显式 <code>All</code> 配置也会因本次修复触发 worker 重建，请按<a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/blob/v0.8.0/keps/260-leaderonly-service/README.md#upgrade-considerations" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">升级说明</a>安排变更窗口。</p>
<p>相关 PR：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/sgl-project/rbg/pull/418" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">#418</a> — fix: worker pods get no DNS identity under sharedServiceSelection=All</li>
</ul>
<p>贡献者：</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/diw-zw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@diw-zw</a></li>
</ul>]]></content:encoded>
            <category>release</category>
        </item>
